<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rapport d'activité — {{ employee.email }}</title>
    <style>
        @media print { body{margin:0;padding:0} .no-print{display:none!important} @page{margin:1.5cm} }
        *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
        body{font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
        .container{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 32px}
        .header{text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:24px;margin-bottom:24px}
        .header h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#4f46e5;margin-bottom:4px}
        .header p{color:#666;font-size:13px}
        .info-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px;padding:16px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0}
        .info-item label{display:block;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600}
        .info-item span{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b}
        .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
        .stat-box{text-align:center;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0}
        .stat-box .value{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}
        .stat-box .label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#64748b}
        table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px}
        th{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;text-align:left}
        td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px}
        tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#f8fafc}
        .footer{margin-top:32px;padding-top:16px;border-top:2px solid #e2e8f0;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8}
        .print-btn{position:fixed;bottom:24px;right:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f46e5,#7c3aed);color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(79,70,229,.4);z-index:999}
        .print-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(79,70,229,.5)}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>📊 Rapport d'Activité</h1>
        <p>Généré le {{ 'now'|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }} — Talentos RH</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-item"><label>Employé</label><span>{{ employee.email }}</span></div>
        <div class="info-item"><label>Rôle</label><span>{{ employee.role }}</span></div>
        <div class="info-item"><label>Inscrit le</label><span>{{ employee.createdAt ? employee.createdAt|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}</span></div>
        <div class="info-item"><label>Projets associés</label><span>{{ projectNames|join(', ')|default('Aucun') }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="value" style="color:#4f46e5">{{ activities|length }}</div><div class="label">Activités</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="value" style="color:#06b6d4">{{ totalHours }}h</div><div class="label">Heures totales</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="value" style="color:#10b981">{{ totalProjects }}</div><div class="label">Projets</div></div>
    </div>
    <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">Détail des activités</h3>
    <table>
        <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Date</th><th>Description</th><th>Projet</th><th>Heures</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for a in activities %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
            <td>{{ a.activityDate ? a.activityDate|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}</td>
            <td>{{ a.description }}</td>
            <td>{{ a.project ? a.project.name : '—' }}</td>
            <td style="font-weight:600">{{ a.hoursWorked ?? '—' }}{% if a.hoursWorked %}h{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% else %}
        <tr><td colspan="5" style="text-align:center;padding:24px;color:#94a3b8">Aucune activité enregistrée.</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Document généré automatiquement par <strong>Talentos</strong> — Ce rapport est confidentiel.</p>
    </div>
</div>
<button class="print-btn no-print" onclick="window.print()"><i class="bi bi-printer me-2"></i>Imprimer / PDF</button>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
</body>
</html>
